OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leaders alert minister to
OL,4,Amayor concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo council leaders have called for an
OL,7,Furgent meeting with the government amid
OL,8,Fconcerns about the way the Hull and
OL,9,FEast Yorkshire Combined Authority
OL,10,F(HEYCA) is being run.
OL,12,FIn a letter to local government
OL,13,Fminister Jim McMahon, Hull City Council
OL,14,Fleader Mike Ross and East Riding of
OL,15,FYorkshire Council leader Anne Handley
OL,16,Fsaid there was "little clear evidence
OL,17,Fof a vision for the region".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
