OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leaders alert minister to
OL,4,Amayor concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We want to see devolution succeed in
OL,7,Fthis region, but are understandably
OL,8,Fconcerned that this is not going to
OL,9,Fhappen on the current course," they
OL,10,Fadded.
OL,12,FReform UK Mayor Luke Campbell, who
OL,13,Fleads HEYCA, said: "I'm disappointed,
OL,14,Fbut I can't say I'm surprised. There's
OL,15,Fbeen far too much politics since I
OL,16,Fbecame mayor."
